"593966966655966", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974465_593966973322632_4982309690223554663_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XPG5bWcNLSEQ7kNvwHMkXrB&_nc_oc=AdpOic8KeeqFC1Ikn58PvUlh_iNuJ6sWYQY9NflR_tkYnYwTd2TJUdrTFC30tzcFxIU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRxmTh2qATo1fBJ-kZS3znwPPwHwsODlLNuKxUwfplsUQ&oe=6AF32711"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "1046485386953462", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001725_1046485390286795_4079334239054220795_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GnmS-WePeZgQ7kNvwHhwIWt&_nc_oc=Adrd2sRlEmXFAETJuBBJkidY65OrKnYn_NS8TmMt342COVvu0KM5KlrCyo3QUbkhIMk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSWohiWQGUsohP5N_0ve1miMDymZ8TZJiRdmEHA1TRboA&oe=6AF32E77"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "871826811724630", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86620689_871826815057963_7999414902838153684_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4kdLuy8ayhgQ7kNvwGLm4oz&_nc_oc=Adp0JAbb8BETZ5SlkecyX3DETK8wFusBy_ECnmdmpHMorFeyXTamKu2AjgThcgD1hLY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmxlsO7I-IitBgvIsDMeoJiHnbVf5KZZ3vnM-soxpG4w&oe=6AF35BC4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TacticalAssaultVRTrailerCoverImage.png", "id": "3497936147171850", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540506_3497936150505183_3880119875800127416_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5jndHRiADssQ7kNvwEyfpHe&_nc_oc=AdrHnrH_f2ZM8SIbX4Hr21g5VC4AqquNtJEXpOuVg0rqwReMd3u1Q5IOeMGaGF2Wrc8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5lQJ0PvsYOI-YSojMXBYZtYnN2JcOo8d6-KREXOKDNA&oe=6AF34396"}, "display_name": "Tactical Assault VR", "keywords": ["TAVR", "Military", "SWAT", "Police", "Tactical"], "long_description": "# Become part of an elite special forces unit in Tactical Assault VR!\n\nTactical Assault VR is an intense tactical shooter where you use real-world CQB (Close Quarters Battles) tactics to stack up, breach doors and eliminate threats. Play solo or join an online co-op special forces unit in missions around the world.\n\n# Features\n**PvE Missions: Solo or Online Multiplayer Co-Op with Up to 6 Players**\n{1487526115258066}\n\n**PvP: Competitive Online Multiplayer**\n{1082589306850803}\n\n**9 Non-Linear Asymmetrical Missions, 3 Wave Shooter Experiences, Room Randomizer & Sandbox Mode**\n\nPlan your assault. The choice is yours.\n{448475627682065}\n\n**Game Mode Variety**\n\nBomb Defusal, Hostage Rescue, Enemy Surrendering, High-Value Target (HVT) Eliminations, Mini Games, Killhouse, Hardcore Mode.\n{1946208202559962}\n\n**60+ Detailed Weapons and Counting**\n\nCustomize your loadout with tactical gear including vests, helmets, weapons, scopes, sights, grips and breaching equipment.\n{1007758587705278}", "short_description": "Tactical Assault VR is an intense tactical shooter where you use real-world CQB (Close Quarters Battles) tactics to stack up, breach doors and eliminate threats. Play solo or join an online co-op special forces unit in missions around the world."}]}, "developer_name": "HammerFire Interactive", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hammerfireinteractive.net/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HammerFire Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hammerfireinteractive.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_l